# Intake

- Pre-LLM text quality: `assessIntakeTextQuality` — do not remove without replacing an equivalent gate.
- Client UI must use `clientSummary` / `toClientSummary` and format helpers — never raw extraction JSON.
- Honour `extractionUsable`; blank/garbled extracts must force rewrite, not program start.
